Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat(ui): add inline thinking effort selector to the
 composer

Mounted in the composer action row immediately before the context-window
indicator, in the same flex container and with no absolute positioning.
Ariakit menu, portalled and top-placed so it opens upward and is not clipped.

Writes through useSetIndexOptions, so the choice persists with the rest of the
conversation params. An effect reconciles the stored value with the active
spec: seeds the default, repairs a value the new model does not offer, and
carries a supported one over. Hidden for specs without effortSelector and
when interface.parameters is disabled; disabled while submitting.
